{"id":"425db3849669bc75","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-set11-symmetric-difference-set.md","title":"ZFC Set11 Symmetric Difference Set","display":"df-zfc-set11-symmetric-difference-set — ZFC Set11 Symmetric Difference Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set11-symmetric-difference-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set11-symmetric-difference-set"],"display":"df-zfc-set11-symmetric-difference-set — ZFC Set11 Symmetric Difference Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set11-symmetric-difference-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set11-symmetric-difference-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set11-symmetric-difference-set — ZFC Set11 Symmetric Difference Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,A,B\\in V\">\\(D,A,B\\in V\\)</span> (set parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet11SymmetricDifferenceSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet11SymmetricDifferenceSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}symmetric\\text{-}difference\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet11SymmetricDifferenceSet}_S(D,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\nD=(A\\setminus B)\\cup(B\\setminus A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}symmetric\\text{-}difference\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet11SymmetricDifferenceSet}_S(D,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\nD=(A\\setminus B)\\cup(B\\setminus A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>等式形式消除了原公式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leftrightarrow\">\\(\\leftrightarrow\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lor\">\\(\\lor\\)</span> 的作用域歧义。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D,A,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet11SymmetricDifferenceSet}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}symmetric\\text{-}difference\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet11SymmetricDifferenceSet}_S(D,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\nD=(A\\setminus B)\\cup(B\\setminus A)","display":true},{"tex":"\\leftrightarrow","display":false},{"tex":"\\lor","display":false}],"bytes":809,"backlinks":[{"id":"3acb61572e0c31be","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSet11SymmetricDifferenceSet}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch06/58-df-zfc-set11-symmetric-difference-set.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3419","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-set11-symmetric-difference-set.md|58-df-zfc-set11-symmetric-difference-set]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3"]}